# E34 -- Is creature_raw.frequency a REVERSIBLE lever on cavern spawning? Addendum 52 suppressed two species and could not show their return — neither came back in 24,165 ticks, though other species did, which is inconclusive rather than negative. Here seven common cavern species are suppressed together for the first half of a season and restored at the half-way tick, against a control never touched. The tool is DISABLED throughout: this measures the game, not the roster. Cavern counts exclude the magma sea and the underworld by cave depth, which addendum 51 showed were being miscounted as cavern wildlife.
