## Predictions (written before the run)
- frequency is a reversible lever: near-zero arrivals of the seven before tick 67200, a clear return after, while the control has them throughout
- zeroing latches: near-zero in both halves of the suppressed arm while the control has them throughout
- frequency is not the lever: the seven arrive in both halves of the suppressed arm; addendum 52's result was chance

